t("An aura of death surrounds you.\n#CRIMSON#Penalty : #WHITE#Fear of Death: %+d%% resistance against damage from the undead.\n#CRIMSON#Power 1+: %sPower over Death: %+d%% damage against the undead.\n#CRIMSON#Power 2+: %s%+d Luck, %+d Strength, %+d Magic\n#CRIMSON#Power 3+: %sLiving Death: Ghoulish retch heals you. Once every %d turns, retch (level %d) when you fall below %d%% health\n#CRIMSON#Power 4+: %sReprieve from Death: Humanoids you slay have a %d%% chance to rise to fight beside you as ghouls for 6 turns.", "An aura of death surrounding you.\n#CRIMSON#Penalty: #WHITE#Fear of Death: %+d% resistencia contra daño del undead.\n§Power 1+: %sPower over Death: %+d%% damage against the undead.\n§Power 2+: %s%+d Luck, %+d Stwitch Una vez que cada %d gira, retch (nivel %d) cuando tú cae debajo §%d §%% salud\n#CRIMSON#Power 4+: %sReprieve from Death: Humanoids you slay have a %d%% probabilidad to rise to fight along you as ghouls for 6 turns.", "tformat")
t("You feel your grip on reality slipping.\n#CRIMSON#Penalty : #WHITE#Fractured Sanity: %+d%% Mind Resistance, %+d%% Confusion Immunity\n#CRIMSON#Power 1+: %sUnleashed: %+d%% critical damage, %+d%% off-hand weapon damage\n#CRIMSON#Power 2+: %s%+d Luck, %+d Dexterity\n#CRIMSON#Power 3+: %sConspirator: Your madness is contagious. Every time you critically damage a foe there is a %d%% chance to spread one of your current detrimental mental effect to them.\n#CRIMSON#Power 4+: %sMania: Once per turn, when an attack does more than %0.1f%% of your life, the remaining cooldown of all your talents is reduced by 1.", "Tú siente tu agarre en el deslizamiento de la realidad.\n#CRIMSON#Penalidad: #WHITE#Santidad forzada: %+d% Resistencia mental, %+d% Confusión Immunity\n§Power 1+: %sSin blanquear: %+d% daño crítico, %+d% daño de las armas fuera de la mano\n§Power 2+FS Cada vez que tú daña críticamente a un enemigo hay una oportunidad %d%% de difundir uno de sus efectos mentales perjudiciales actuales para ellos.\n#CRIMSON#Power 4+: %sMania: Una vez por turno, cuando un ataque haces más que %0.1f% de tu vida, la refrigeración restante de todos sus talentos se reduce en 1.", "tformat")
t("A shroud of darkness seems to fall across your path.\n#CRIMSON#Penalty : #WHITE#Shroud of Weakness: Small chance of becoming enveloped in a Shroud of Weakness (reduces damage dealt by %d%%) for 4 turns.\n#CRIMSON#Power 1+: %sNightwalker: %+d Darkness Resistance, %+d%% Max Darkness Resistance, %+d See Invisible\n#CRIMSON#Power 2+: %s%+d Luck, %+d Constitution\n#CRIMSON#Power 3+: %sShroud of Passing: Your form seems to fade as you move, reducing all damage taken by %d%% for 1 turn after movement.\n#CRIMSON#Power 4+: %sShroud of Death: The power of every kill seems to envelop you like a shroud, reducing all damage taken by %d%% for 3 turns.", "Un golpe de la oscuridad parece caer a través de tu camino.\n§#CRIMSON#Penalty: §#WHITE#Shroud of Weakness: Small probabilidad of becoming overd in a Shroud of Weakness (reduces damage dealt by %d%) for 4 turn.\n#CRIMSON# §§ §§.", "tformat")
t("Horrible visions fill your mind.\n#CRIMSON#Penalty : #WHITE#Plagued by Visions: Your mental save has a 20%% chance to be reduced by %d%% when tested.\n#CRIMSON#Power 1+: %sRemoved from Reality: %+d Physical Resistance, %+d Maximum Physical Resistance\n#CRIMSON#Power 2+: %s%+d Luck, %+d Willpower\n#CRIMSON#Power 3+: %sHarrow: When a foe attempts to inflict a detrimental effect upon you, your harrowing aura retaliates against a random foe in range 10, dealing %d mind and %d darkness damage.\n#CRIMSON#Power 4+: %sNightmare: Each time you are damaged by a foe there is a chance (currently %d%%) of triggering a radius %d nightmare (summon Terrors and chances to slow, deal %d Mind damage, and deal %d Darkness damage) for 8 turns. The chance grows each time you are struck but fades over time.", "Las visiones horribles llenan tu mente.\n#CRIMSON#Penalidad: #WHITE#Plagado por Visiones: Tu ahorro mental tienes una oportunidad de 20% para ser reducido por §%d% cuando se prueba.\n#CRIMSON#Power 1+: %sRemovido de la Realidad: %+d Resistencia Física, %+d Resistencia Física Máxima\npower#CRIMSON#Power 2+§ Cuando un enemigo intenta infligir un efecto perjudicial sobre tú, tu aura arrojo represalias contra un enemigo aleatorio en el rango 10, tratando %d mente y %d daño de las tinieblas.\n#CRIMSON#Power 4+: %sNightmare: Cada vez que se daña por un enemigo hay una posibilidad (actualmente %d%) de desencadenar una pesadilla de radio §14 Daño mental y trato %d Daño de la oscuridad) por 8 vueltas. La oportunidad crece cada vez que te golpean pero se desvanecen con el tiempo.", "tformat")
t("Mayhem and destruction seem to follow you.\n#CRIMSON#Penalty : #WHITE#Lost Fortune: You seem to find less gold in your journeys.\n#CRIMSON#Power 1+: %sMissplaced Endeavours: The endeavours of those around you begin to fail (+%d%% chance to avoid traps).\n#CRIMSON#Power 2+: %s%+d Luck, %+d Cunning\n#CRIMSON#Power 3+: %sMissed Opportunities: Opportunities are fleeting, and those close to you begin to miss them (+%d%% evasion).\n#CRIMSON#Power 4+: %sUnfortunate End: The damage you deal will increase by %d%% if the increase would be enough to kill your opponent.", "El caos y la destrucción parecen seguirte.\n#CRIMSON#Penalidad: #WHITE#Perdida Fortuna: Pareces encontrar menos oro en tus viajes.\n#CRIMSON#Power 1+: %sMisplaced Endeavours: Los esfuerzos de los que te rodean comienzan a fracasar (+§%d §§ §§ §§ § § § §§.", "tformat")
t("Currently Twisted Anomaly: %s\n\n\t\t%s", "En la actualidad, Anomalía Twisted: %s\n\n%s", "tformat")
